        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage FWKF, Wakefield Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wakefield Handleset has a classic oval design with elegant, curved lines; it features two small oval faces and a graceful sweeping handle. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for smaller entranceways. This Schlage Wakefield Handleset is paired with your choice of stylish interior trim knob or lever. Choose from a single cylinder handleset or a dummy function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Wakefield Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security for Single Cylinder Function.</li>\r\n<li>Easy one tool installation - installs with just a Phillips screwdriver.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys for Single Cylinder Function..</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Wakefield Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: 8-3/8 - 9-7/8</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Height: 18-3/16\" with 5.5\" door prep</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 12-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Prep: 4\" - 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable through bolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-F60WKF-specifications.pdf?v=1704262417\"><b>Schlage Wakefield Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish. The Bowery Knob is not available in Matte Black. The Andover Knob is not available in Matte Black. The Flair Lever is not available in Matte Black.\r\n</i>\r\n</p>",
