                "description": "The Wakefield Handleset has a classic oval design with elegant, curved lines; it features two small oval faces and a graceful sweeping handle. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for smaller entranceways. This Schlage Wakefield Handleset is paired with your choice of stylish interior trim knob or lever. Choose from a single cylinder handleset or a dummy function.",
